  (c) Non-profit or internal administrative execution without financial gain.

2. COMMERCIAL RESTRICTIONS & RESERVATION OF RIGHTS
The Copyright Holder strictly retains all commercial, financial, and monetization rights to the Software. You are EXPLICITLY PROHIBITED from doing any of the following without a separate, written commercial agreement signed by the Copyright Holder:
  (a) Selling, reselling, renting, leasing, sublicensing, or distributing the Software or any portion thereof;
  (b) Offering or operating the Software as a paid service, hosted solution, Software-as-a-Service (SaaS), Managed Service Provider (MSP) offering, or cloud deployment for third parties;
  (c) Integrating the Software into any proprietary or commercial product, service, or commercial offering;
  (d) Utilizing the Software, its source code, or derivative works to train, fine-tune, or build competing software products or commercial AI models.

3. DERIVATIVE WORKS AND CONTRIBUTIONS
Any modifications, derivatives, or enhancements created by you remain subject to the commercial restrictions of this License. You may not distribute modified versions of the Software under any other terms or open-source licenses.

